cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this software in your research, please cite it as below."
title: "Aegis: A Production-Grade Coverage-Guided Fuzzing Platform"
abstract: "Aegis is a modular, language-agnostic fuzzing platform designed for security research, vulnerability discovery, and software assurance. It implements coverage-guided fuzzing with deterministic mutation strategies, distributed orchestration, and multi-target support including binary, service, smart contract, and kernel-level fuzzing."
type: software
authors:
  - family-names: "Aegis"
    given-names: "Security Research Team"
repository-code: "https://github.com/aegis-security/aegis"
license: MIT
keywords:
  - fuzzing
  - vulnerability-discovery
  - coverage-guided-fuzzing
  - security-testing
  - software-assurance
  - mutation-testing
  - dynamic-analysis
version: 0.4.0
date-released: 2026-05-23
